OL,3,GNEWSAIslanders don Guernsey jumpers to
OL,4,Ahelp hospice
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommunities have rallied together to
OL,7,Fmark the annual celebration of the
OL,8,FGuernsey knitted jumper which is
OL,9,Ftraditionally made on the island.
OL,11,FOn Thursday it was 'Wear a Guernsey
OL,12,FDay' during which money was raised for
OL,13,FLes Bourgs hospice.
OL,15,FThe event took place in Market Square
OL,16,Fwith traditional food, stalls and a
OL,17,Fchance to learn more about the charity.
OL,19,FGuernsey's politicians supported the
OL,20,Fcause too - with special permission
OL,21,Ffrom the Bailiff to wear their jumpers
OL,22,Fin the States chamber.
